WEBVTT


00:01:15.447 --> 00:01:18.325
Christmas Day, 2004
The Indian Ocean near Indonesia


00:01:18.527 --> 00:01:20.722
Keep your eyes open!


00:01:25.407 --> 00:01:27.443
Hurry up, guys!


00:01:27.527 --> 00:01:29.802
1, 2, 3!


00:02:10.727 --> 00:02:12.126
Did they find them?


00:02:12.727 --> 00:02:14.319
The Eok-jo, right?


00:02:15.007 --> 00:02:16.122
You're sure?


00:02:17.087 --> 00:02:20.477
Don't let them die out there!


00:02:21.527 --> 00:02:24.041
Did they find my father?


00:02:24.127 --> 00:02:27.483
They did. Don't worry!


00:02:27.967 --> 00:02:33.917
-We've got great news, everyone!
-Are they all safe?


00:03:01.367 --> 00:03:04.996
Let's get the fucking hell out of here,
you motherfucker!


00:03:05.207 --> 00:03:06.276
Man-sik...


00:03:06.807 --> 00:03:08.206
Stop it and go.


00:03:08.287 --> 00:03:10.642
Just hold on for a little longer!


00:03:10.927 --> 00:03:14.442
Sons of bitches! You're not gonna help?


00:03:15.007 --> 00:03:16.156
Man-sik!


00:03:16.847 --> 00:03:17.962
Yes.


00:03:20.727 --> 00:03:24.561
Please take care of Yeon-hee for me, okay?


00:03:24.647 --> 00:03:26.922
Don't say that.


00:03:27.007 --> 00:03:29.726
I'm getting you out of here.


00:03:29.887 --> 00:03:31.525
Get out of here.


00:03:31.607 --> 00:03:33.484
Hurry.


00:04:08.607 --> 00:04:10.757
The tsunami's killed


00:04:10.847 --> 00:04:13.919
thousands in Southeast Asia.


00:04:14.007 --> 00:04:16.043
Here's more from our correspondent.


00:04:17.607 --> 00:04:21.566
People evacuate as giant waves
rush into the coastal area.


00:04:21.647 --> 00:04:25.356
After it struck, the coast was
left with ruins and corpses.


00:04:25.487 --> 00:04:30.277
At 10 p.m., an earthquake measuring 8.9
struck near Sumatra Island.


00:04:30.847 --> 00:04:35.398
The following tidal waves caused
damage in India, Sri Lanka...


00:04:36.647 --> 00:04:37.716
My daddy is gone.


00:04:45.047 --> 00:04:48.960
"Tidal Wave"


00:05:33.607 --> 00:05:37.077
The earthquake in Japan has struck
mostly on the east side,


00:05:37.167 --> 00:05:43.561
but now it's being felt more frequently
on the west side, close to our border.


00:05:47.287 --> 00:05:48.561
Come on, son. Sing. 1, 2, 3.


00:05:48.647 --> 00:05:51.207
Playing is always fun


00:05:51.887 --> 00:05:54.720
Gather up, friends


00:05:54.807 --> 00:05:56.877
Attaboy, Seung-hyun!


00:05:57.047 --> 00:05:58.116
It's always fun


00:05:58.207 --> 00:06:00.675
Yeon-hee! I'm starving!


00:06:00.767 --> 00:06:02.962
-Uncle...
-Seung-hyun, here we go.


00:06:11.127 --> 00:06:13.800
-Pulling out his tooth?
-Sorry, son.


00:06:14.047 --> 00:06:16.720
I won't do it.


00:06:16.807 --> 00:06:18.957
-Where's Yeon-hee?
-On deliveries!


00:06:19.047 --> 00:06:21.641
Promise!


00:06:21.727 --> 00:06:24.480
Man-sik!


00:06:24.567 --> 00:06:26.319
-Come out now!
-What?


00:06:26.407 --> 00:06:27.681
Yeon-hee!


00:06:27.767 --> 00:06:30.327
-What about Yeon-hee?
-Come out!


00:06:30.447 --> 00:06:32.756
Hurry!


00:06:37.567 --> 00:06:39.364
I told you not to sell here!


00:06:39.687 --> 00:06:41.325
I told you very clearly!


00:06:41.407 --> 00:06:43.284
Step aside!


00:06:43.487 --> 00:06:46.081
Where do you get off trying to sell fish


00:06:46.167 --> 00:06:49.125
in front of someone else's
seafood restaurant?


00:06:49.207 --> 00:06:51.357
You're right.


00:06:51.447 --> 00:06:53.403
What are you doing?
Aren't you gonna apologise?


00:06:53.487 --> 00:06:54.886
You got nothing to say, do you?


00:06:54.967 --> 00:06:58.004
-You've got nothing to say for yourself?
-No, nothing.


00:06:58.087 --> 00:07:01.636
Orphaned children all seem to act like that.


00:07:01.727 --> 00:07:04.195
Don't talk that way.


00:07:04.367 --> 00:07:07.086
How dare you look at me like that?


00:07:07.207 --> 00:07:08.242
Stop glaring at her.


00:07:08.327 --> 00:07:10.443
What? You know I'm right!


00:07:10.767 --> 00:07:13.235
-When did I ever act like that?
-Stop talking back!


00:07:13.327 --> 00:07:15.079
What did you just say?


00:07:15.447 --> 00:07:17.915
Did you ever support me
when my parents died?


00:07:18.007 --> 00:07:19.998
What? This bitch just doesn't get it.


00:07:20.087 --> 00:07:22.681
Say it again!


00:07:24.727 --> 00:07:27.685
Stop it, Mom!


00:07:27.847 --> 00:07:29.280
Yeon-hee, calm down!


00:07:30.527 --> 00:07:33.166
Did you allow her to sell here?


00:07:33.327 --> 00:07:34.442
You bastard!


00:07:34.687 --> 00:07:37.759
You stupid fool!


00:07:37.847 --> 00:07:40.156
You're the chief of the
Prosperity Association!


00:07:40.247 --> 00:07:42.602
Why do you always side with her?


00:07:42.687 --> 00:07:46.521
That's why she acts like this!


00:07:46.607 --> 00:07:47.756
That's not it.


00:07:47.847 --> 00:07:49.439
What do you mean, that's not it?


00:07:49.527 --> 00:07:51.518
I'm not gonna put up with this any more!


00:07:51.607 --> 00:07:53.882
Let's see this till the end.


00:07:56.047 --> 00:07:57.480
Mom! Stop it!


00:07:57.567 --> 00:07:58.682
Sit!


00:07:58.767 --> 00:08:00.439
Everyone, sit down!


00:08:02.047 --> 00:08:05.084
I told you not to do that around the arcade.


00:08:05.847 --> 00:08:09.203
People see this, you setting up shop
in front of their arcade,


00:08:09.727 --> 00:08:12.287
how do you think
it will affect my reputation?


00:08:13.767 --> 00:08:16.645
Anyhow, you should show
some respect to your elders.


00:08:16.727 --> 00:08:19.002
Your mom should know
how to behave, too!


00:08:19.207 --> 00:08:21.402
Yeah, I know.


00:08:22.007 --> 00:08:24.646
But even though I want to
give you every convenience,


00:08:24.727 --> 00:08:26.797
I never asked for any favours.


00:08:27.687 --> 00:08:29.006
I didn't mean it.


00:08:34.087 --> 00:08:35.236
Stubborn girl.


00:08:41.807 --> 00:08:45.959
Like you representatives all know, Haeundae
is already a world-class resort area.


00:08:46.047 --> 00:08:49.357
It doesn't make sense not to have


00:08:52.487 --> 00:08:54.682
a single mall in a place like...


00:08:56.607 --> 00:08:58.916
Hey, you bastard!
You already made tons of money.


00:08:59.007 --> 00:09:02.079
Now you want to destroy this place!
You damn jerk!


00:09:02.207 --> 00:09:03.686
Let go, you damned jerk!


00:09:03.767 --> 00:09:05.325
Let's move to the next block.


00:09:05.407 --> 00:09:07.045
Let go of me! You motherfuckers!


00:09:07.127 --> 00:09:10.676
I hate that scumbag.


00:09:12.407 --> 00:09:15.717
Professor Kim continues to persist
with his talk of a mega-tsunami,


00:09:15.807 --> 00:09:17.638
can we get more specific information?


00:09:17.727 --> 00:09:21.037
Before we do that,
you'd better define tsunami jargon.


00:09:21.127 --> 00:09:23.766
Would you mind refraining from
using the term ''mega-tsunami''?


00:09:23.847 --> 00:09:26.361
It makes everyone very uneasy.


00:09:26.487 --> 00:09:28.159
In your hypothetical scenario,


00:09:28.247 --> 00:09:29.965
a large chunk of islands
break off into the sea,


00:09:30.047 --> 00:09:32.800
causing a tidal wave
of unprecedented proportions.


00:09:33.287 --> 00:09:34.481
Do you think this is really possible?


00:09:34.567 --> 00:09:37.957
I'm suggesting that
because there's a possibility.


00:09:38.047 --> 00:09:41.960
Didn't you see what happened
in Southeast Asia and China?


00:09:42.047 --> 00:09:44.880
Do natural disasters warn us
that they are coming?


00:09:46.207 --> 00:09:49.279
Some say that Korea is
a safety zone from earthquakes.


00:09:49.367 --> 00:09:52.006
How many earthquakes above 3.0
do you think we have each year?


00:09:52.087 --> 00:09:53.884
An average of more than 30!


00:09:53.967 --> 00:09:55.719
Is that what you call
an earthquake safety zone?


00:09:55.807 --> 00:09:58.367
Other experts say that


00:09:58.447 --> 00:09:59.960
the possibility is very faint.


00:10:00.047 --> 00:10:03.801
But you insist there's
a strong possibility of such an occurrence!


00:10:03.887 --> 00:10:09.359
All I'm saying is we should
at least form a committee!


00:10:09.447 --> 00:10:11.563
Can't you understand what I'm saying?


00:10:12.727 --> 00:10:16.436
You should've just married
your earthquakes, not me.


00:10:16.527 --> 00:10:18.040
When did you get back in the country?


00:10:18.127 --> 00:10:21.517
-Do you actually have some interest in me?
-When did you get here?


00:10:21.607 --> 00:10:22.676
Last year.


00:10:23.167 --> 00:10:25.158
You could've at least called me.


00:10:25.247 --> 00:10:27.044
Oh, what, you've got no hands?


00:10:27.127 --> 00:10:28.845
You haven't changed a bit.


00:10:28.927 --> 00:10:30.804
You've got me beat.


00:10:32.527 --> 00:10:34.995
Heard you're in charge of
the Haeundae Cultural Expo.


00:10:35.087 --> 00:10:37.123
You really are a competent person.


00:10:38.967 --> 00:10:41.640
-How's Ji-min?
-Now you ask!


00:10:42.287 --> 00:10:44.118
She'll be in 3rd grade next year.


00:10:45.367 --> 00:10:46.436
Mommy!


00:10:47.527 --> 00:10:48.596
Ji-min!


00:10:51.487 --> 00:10:52.556
Who's that?


00:10:54.167 --> 00:10:56.681
This is a professor that mommy knows.
Say hi.


00:10:57.447 --> 00:10:58.926
Hello.


00:11:00.567 --> 00:11:03.718
Ji-min, go ahead
and wait in the car with Hae-chan.


00:11:03.807 --> 00:11:06.446
Bye.


00:11:20.887 --> 00:11:24.323
He's just someone that I met back
in America. We're not together or anything.


00:11:26.007 --> 00:11:30.046
I didn't tell her about you.
It's better that way.


00:11:30.127 --> 00:11:33.324
There's no need to confuse her.
Hope you understand.


00:11:34.327 --> 00:11:36.602
I'd better get going.


00:11:36.687 --> 00:11:38.518
-Take care of yourself.
-Okay.


00:11:46.127 --> 00:11:47.845
Freak!


00:11:48.287 --> 00:11:49.322
You're embarrassing us.


00:11:49.407 --> 00:11:52.399
Why don't you just study at home


00:11:53.007 --> 00:11:55.840
instead of tagging along on our vacation?


00:11:55.927 --> 00:11:57.883
Why didn't you just study harder
on your second try, loser?


00:11:57.967 --> 00:12:01.596
People who can't study always act like this.


00:12:01.807 --> 00:12:02.876
Stop your nagging!


00:12:02.967 --> 00:12:06.004
Get rid of the book now!
The guys aren't approaching us.


00:12:07.207 --> 00:12:08.401
That's too hot.


00:12:08.487 --> 00:12:10.205
Stop posing like that, dork! Get back here!


00:12:10.287 --> 00:12:12.084
How can you be so senseless?


00:12:12.927 --> 00:12:16.966
Can't you feel the guys checking me out?


00:12:19.247 --> 00:12:21.761
-Who?
-I'm done!


00:12:22.527 --> 00:12:24.324
Is it just the 3 of you?


00:12:32.567 --> 00:12:35.035
What do you think?
Is this worth your time?


00:12:35.127 --> 00:12:39.166
What number am I, if you add up
all the girls that have been on this yacht


00:12:39.647 --> 00:12:41.046
-before me?
-You're the first


00:12:41.127 --> 00:12:43.516
to be so stuck up and haughty


00:12:44.487 --> 00:12:46.603
on my yacht.


00:12:47.167 --> 00:12:49.237
Well, you're not so polite yourself.


00:12:49.687 --> 00:12:52.440
Shut up, bitch!


00:12:52.967 --> 00:12:56.721
Do you wanna do a round shot?


00:12:56.807 --> 00:12:59.037
Nobody better break it up.


00:13:16.687 --> 00:13:17.756
Help!


00:13:19.327 --> 00:13:20.680
Boy, I feel dizzy.


00:13:24.007 --> 00:13:25.122
Help!


00:13:28.287 --> 00:13:29.356
Somebody!


00:13:32.687 --> 00:13:33.756
Hold tight!


00:13:34.287 --> 00:13:36.039
Help!


00:13:51.527 --> 00:13:54.883
-Help!
-Let go!


00:13:54.967 --> 00:13:56.764
Let go of me!


00:13:56.847 --> 00:14:00.283
You're crazy! What are you doing?


00:14:31.527 --> 00:14:33.722
Don't! Stop! Stop!


00:14:53.767 --> 00:14:57.442
Because you kept grabbing my head.


00:14:59.647 --> 00:15:01.717
Who are you?


00:15:05.567 --> 00:15:07.364
Yeon-hee!


00:15:09.327 --> 00:15:12.603
Yeon-hee!


00:15:20.727 --> 00:15:21.796
Yeon-hee!


00:15:24.287 --> 00:15:27.882
-What's all this?
-There were some veggies left at the house.


00:15:27.967 --> 00:15:30.276
-Where can I put this?
-I don't need this much.


00:15:30.367 --> 00:15:31.800
-Just take it.
-Here.


00:15:38.247 --> 00:15:39.316
Doctor!


00:15:39.687 --> 00:15:42.121
There's been another earthquake
on the sea bed.


00:15:42.207 --> 00:15:43.526
-An earthquake on the sea floor!
-Where?


00:15:43.607 --> 00:15:46.121
35 km off the west coast of Hokkaido.


00:15:46.207 --> 00:15:48.198
-Intensity?
-3.6.


00:15:48.287 --> 00:15:50.278
-Depth?
-An estimated 30 km.


00:15:51.687 --> 00:15:53.405
Since it's quiet in Japan,


00:15:53.487 --> 00:15:56.001
it's unlikely there'll be a tidal wave.
But something's strange.


00:15:56.087 --> 00:15:57.156
What?


00:15:57.247 --> 00:16:01.035
The epicentre's been moving toward us
since the beginning of this year.


00:16:12.167 --> 00:16:15.603
-I'm sorry to bother you with this.
-No, it's okay.


00:16:15.727 --> 00:16:18.116
I'll trust in you, Congressman Park.


00:16:18.207 --> 00:16:20.277
I'll go ahead and do all that I can.


00:16:20.407 --> 00:16:22.762
But don't think
that everything is settled just yet.


00:16:22.847 --> 00:16:26.283
Sometimes things work out,
and sometimes they don't. Am I right?


00:16:27.607 --> 00:16:28.881
Let's get going.


00:16:35.207 --> 00:16:38.961
-You got everything together all right?
-Yes, I put it in the car trunk.


00:16:40.207 --> 00:16:41.879
Crazy bastard!


00:16:42.687 --> 00:16:44.723
''Some things don't work out''?


00:16:45.527 --> 00:16:48.963
There'll be no approval for
the Haeundae Golden Beach, right?


00:16:49.367 --> 00:16:52.677
If that's approved,
we're not going to just watch.


00:16:52.767 --> 00:16:55.884
You should ask
the construction division about that.


00:16:55.967 --> 00:16:57.082
Don't worry.


00:16:57.167 --> 00:16:59.362
The ward head swore on his position.


00:16:59.447 --> 00:17:02.166
And you believe that?
Choi Eok-jo's not a pushover.


00:17:02.247 --> 00:17:05.159
I told you not to talk about that guy!


00:17:06.327 --> 00:17:08.887
Bottle's empty.
Yeon-hee, bring some more drinks.


00:17:08.967 --> 00:17:10.639
That's all there is.


00:17:10.727 --> 00:17:13.195
Again? You need to run your business right.


00:17:13.287 --> 00:17:15.676
-Keep some in stock.
-Shut up, you jerk!


00:17:16.207 --> 00:17:17.606
I'll buy some and be back in a flash!


00:17:17.687 --> 00:17:20.679
No, no, you stay here.
I'll go and borrow some.


00:17:20.767 --> 00:17:22.723
Sit, sit.


00:17:22.807 --> 00:17:24.798
Sit down, man!


00:17:24.887 --> 00:17:26.559
Hey, isn't it about time
you two lived together?


00:17:26.647 --> 00:17:29.320
It's easy to see, so stop denying it.


00:17:29.407 --> 00:17:32.558
When her father died,
he left her under your care.


00:17:32.647 --> 00:17:34.444
-Knock it off!
-Stop talking and just drink.


00:17:34.527 --> 00:17:35.676
Why?


00:17:36.727 --> 00:17:38.445
How could you say that
to someone who has a wife?


00:17:38.527 --> 00:17:40.722
What do you mean, ''wife''? Shit!


00:17:40.807 --> 00:17:44.356
It was just a one night stand.
She doesn't deserve it.


00:17:44.447 --> 00:17:46.438
Even so, she gave him Seung-hyun!


00:17:46.527 --> 00:17:49.280
So what? Right after his birth,
she ran off with his money.


00:17:49.367 --> 00:17:51.597
Hey! I told you to stop!


00:17:51.687 --> 00:17:54.155
Every time someone talks about his wife,
he gets defensive.


00:17:54.247 --> 00:17:56.078
To be frank, your wife...


00:17:56.167 --> 00:17:58.556
I said shut up!


00:17:58.647 --> 00:17:59.841
Sit down.


00:17:59.927 --> 00:18:01.997
What kind of grades does your son get?


00:18:02.087 --> 00:18:03.884
Sit down, man!


00:18:04.607 --> 00:18:08.202
My son's a moron, your son's a genius,


00:18:08.287 --> 00:18:10.005
you must be fucking proud.


00:18:10.087 --> 00:18:12.396
Why are you being like this?
Stop acting weird!


00:18:12.487 --> 00:18:18.084
You're having a grand old time here.


00:18:18.167 --> 00:18:20.681
You! Give me back the plates
that you borrowed. I need them too.


00:18:20.767 --> 00:18:22.758
I'll return them
as soon as these gentlemen leave.


00:18:22.847 --> 00:18:24.405
What are you talking about?


00:18:24.487 --> 00:18:27.047
Our place is full of customers.
I need them now!


00:18:27.127 --> 00:18:30.483
You've got to have a sense of dignity
before doing business.


00:18:30.567 --> 00:18:33.035
Mom, please. The chief is here.


00:18:33.127 --> 00:18:34.355
She said she'll return them
as soon as we're done.


00:18:34.447 --> 00:18:35.880
Crazy fool! Shut your mouth!


00:18:35.967 --> 00:18:38.003
Got no place that'll serve you,
so you've crawled here?


00:18:38.087 --> 00:18:41.523
Okay, I got it. Let's go.


00:18:41.607 --> 00:18:43.563
Chief, let's move to the restaurant up there.


00:18:43.647 --> 00:18:46.161
-I'm all right.
-Are you happy now?


00:18:46.247 --> 00:18:49.398
Yeah, I am. You jerk!


00:18:56.287 --> 00:18:58.676
-Sorry about that.
-It's too much.


00:19:09.207 --> 00:19:11.721
What's wrong with you today?


00:19:12.407 --> 00:19:16.002
Don't hold it all in,
just tell me what's going on.


00:19:16.087 --> 00:19:19.079
I'll fix everything for you.


00:19:19.207 --> 00:19:21.323
Is it because you're lonely at night?


00:19:21.727 --> 00:19:24.480
What do you think of Man-sik?


00:19:24.567 --> 00:19:25.636
Man-sik?


00:19:26.367 --> 00:19:28.005
-Choi Man-sik?
-Yes.


00:19:28.127 --> 00:19:31.005
-He's terrible.
-Why?


00:19:31.087 --> 00:19:33.681
He leaves a bad impression.
And on top of that, his eyes slant.


00:19:33.767 --> 00:19:35.598
And your eyes are that great?


00:19:35.847 --> 00:19:36.916
Enough.


00:19:40.047 --> 00:19:44.199
When he was younger,
he was really handsome.


00:19:44.447 --> 00:19:46.756
Handsome? Can you see out of those eyes?


00:19:52.167 --> 00:19:55.284
Are you insane?
Why do I have to come with you?


00:19:55.367 --> 00:19:57.517
You've been eating on the house.
Now it's time to pay the price!


00:19:57.607 --> 00:20:00.167
-Is this why you fed me?
-I told you I'm paying.


00:20:00.247 --> 00:20:03.876
-Paying what? 10,000 won?
-Do you think money just grows on trees?


00:20:04.567 --> 00:20:06.285
You're really out of your mind, aren't you?


00:20:06.367 --> 00:20:08.835
Stop messing around. We're leaving.


00:20:08.927 --> 00:20:10.838
Christ!


00:20:11.887 --> 00:20:13.843
Yeon-hee!


00:20:14.007 --> 00:20:15.725
Yeah?


00:20:15.847 --> 00:20:17.485
Wanna go see


00:20:17.607 --> 00:20:19.120
a baseball game later?


00:20:19.207 --> 00:20:20.322
-Baseball?
-Right, the Giants game.


00:20:20.407 --> 00:20:21.840
I'm going with


00:20:22.287 --> 00:20:23.845
people from


00:20:24.447 --> 00:20:26.244
the commerce association.


00:20:26.607 --> 00:20:28.165
You can join


00:20:28.527 --> 00:20:31.041
and get to know everyone.


00:20:31.127 --> 00:20:32.276
No, I'm fine.


00:20:32.367 --> 00:20:34.756
-I'll go! What time is it?
-You just shut up.


00:20:34.847 --> 00:20:37.315
How fortunate to get
to see a baseball game.


00:20:37.407 --> 00:20:40.365
Yeon-hee! Come with me!


00:20:40.767 --> 00:20:41.916
He's lost it.


00:20:43.927 --> 00:20:46.236
Please! Yeon-hee!


00:20:46.407 --> 00:20:48.159
Jerk!


00:20:58.327 --> 00:21:00.761
Come on! You came here to get drunk?


00:21:00.967 --> 00:21:03.925
You're supposed to drink
in these kinds of places.


00:21:04.727 --> 00:21:06.445
You want some?


00:21:06.567 --> 00:21:07.636
No!


00:21:15.807 --> 00:21:17.923
-You son of a bitch!
-Are you insane?


00:21:18.647 --> 00:21:20.285
Lee Dae-ho hits the ball,


00:21:21.407 --> 00:21:25.286
Park catches it reaching first base.
He's out. Double play out again.


00:21:25.367 --> 00:21:26.925
What the hell?


00:21:27.007 --> 00:21:29.999
Is it that hard to hit like this?


00:21:30.087 --> 00:21:32.681
This is how many today?


00:21:32.767 --> 00:21:35.486
What happened to your lips?


00:21:35.567 --> 00:21:38.206
This?


00:21:38.527 --> 00:21:43.362
-It's nothing.
-Well, it can't be nothing...


00:21:43.527 --> 00:21:45.165
Give it to me straight.


00:21:45.487 --> 00:21:48.206
Who's this crazy girl
who sucked on your face?


00:21:48.327 --> 00:21:50.477
You're not gonna tell us?


00:21:50.607 --> 00:21:52.245
I'm not crazy, all right?


00:22:02.207 --> 00:22:04.846
Throw to first base! He's out.


00:22:04.927 --> 00:22:06.918
It's the 3rd time Lee Dae-ho is
caught out in a double play.


00:22:07.007 --> 00:22:09.077
Consider yourself lucky


00:22:09.207 --> 00:22:10.481
I came in person


00:22:10.567 --> 00:22:12.205
and not sued you instead.


00:22:12.447 --> 00:22:13.482
You understand?


00:22:13.567 --> 00:22:15.478
What do you mean?


00:22:15.607 --> 00:22:18.041
Did you think
you could get away with this?


00:22:18.247 --> 00:22:19.396
You see this?


00:22:20.047 --> 00:22:23.039
Don't you think you should
feel responsible for my eye?


00:22:23.847 --> 00:22:26.315
How are you going to compensate me?


00:22:27.207 --> 00:22:28.481
Compensation?


00:22:29.967 --> 00:22:32.003
-How much you get per life?
-What?


00:22:32.207 --> 00:22:33.720
Don't they pay you by the person?


00:22:33.807 --> 00:22:36.196
We get a salary.


00:22:36.407 --> 00:22:38.079
Then how much do you make per month?


00:22:38.167 --> 00:22:39.680
About a million won.


00:22:39.847 --> 00:22:41.041
Just one million?


00:22:41.127 --> 00:22:43.846
-Yeah.
-That's how much they pay


00:22:44.327 --> 00:22:46.602
-for you to save people's lives?
-Well, I can't say...


00:22:46.687 --> 00:22:47.722
I am the prince of the sea


00:22:47.807 --> 00:22:48.842
Excuse me.


00:22:50.367 --> 00:22:52.278
Yes, this is Choi Hyung-sik.


00:22:53.087 --> 00:22:55.521
Yes, sir, I will return to base immediately.


00:22:55.927 --> 00:22:57.838
Hello.


00:22:58.207 --> 00:23:00.084
Your employee won't be leaving


00:23:00.167 --> 00:23:02.362
because he's made some commotion.


00:23:02.887 --> 00:23:04.525
How the hell do you train these guys?


00:23:04.607 --> 00:23:07.360
Jesus, you are not allowed to... Hello?


00:23:11.607 --> 00:23:13.802
Wow, it's breathtaking!


00:23:14.807 --> 00:23:16.763
What did you say the name of this place is?


00:23:16.847 --> 00:23:17.916
I-gi-dae!


00:23:18.167 --> 00:23:20.476
I-gi-dae? Is that someone's name?


00:23:21.287 --> 00:23:22.515
It's an interesting name.


00:23:22.607 --> 00:23:24.245
It's not a person's name.


00:23:24.447 --> 00:23:25.800
2 geishas embraced an enemy general


00:23:25.887 --> 00:23:29.277
and threw themselves
into the water below with him.


00:23:29.367 --> 00:23:30.641
-That's why.
-So?


00:23:32.247 --> 00:23:34.283
''I'' means ''2'' and ''gi'' means ''geisha''!


00:23:34.927 --> 00:23:35.962
So?


00:23:36.927 --> 00:23:40.556
''I'' is ''2'', ''gi'' is ''geisha''! Two geishas.
Is it that hard to understand?


00:23:40.647 --> 00:23:41.716
-Yes?
-Where are you?


00:23:41.807 --> 00:23:43.240
Who are you with?


00:23:43.327 --> 00:23:45.557
Me? With the Prince of the Sea!


00:23:45.647 --> 00:23:47.763
You mean the comedian Park Myung-soo?


00:23:47.927 --> 00:23:49.804
-Is he in Busan now?
-Idiot.


00:23:50.127 --> 00:23:52.595
Hey, Joon-ha is pissed off.
He won't hang out with us.


00:23:52.687 --> 00:23:54.917
Get your ass over here, now!


00:23:55.007 --> 00:23:58.238
No! I'm going to stay here
and go back tomorrow.


00:24:02.247 --> 00:24:03.316
What?


00:24:03.607 --> 00:24:06.519
Does the idea of sleeping with me
make your heart race?


00:24:06.607 --> 00:24:07.960
You're ridiculous.


00:24:08.087 --> 00:24:10.726
Don't get carried away!
I'm gonna go back later!


00:24:10.807 --> 00:24:12.320
I know. I thought so.


00:24:12.847 --> 00:24:14.678
Your face turned red.


00:24:15.487 --> 00:24:18.684
It's because I'm drinking. It happens.


00:24:19.167 --> 00:24:23.763
You know what? You're very good-looking.


00:24:24.287 --> 00:24:27.484
But when you open your mouth,
your accent ruins everything.


00:24:28.127 --> 00:24:30.163
Actually,


00:24:30.327 --> 00:24:32.795
I can speak without an ''assent''.


00:24:32.887 --> 00:24:34.161
It's not ''assent''.


00:24:34.327 --> 00:24:36.522
It's ''accent'', got it?


00:24:37.647 --> 00:24:39.558
Do you usually suck at talking?


00:24:44.367 --> 00:24:45.720
Don't worry!


00:24:46.047 --> 00:24:47.446
He'll get out soon.


00:24:47.847 --> 00:24:49.200
Thank you so much!


00:24:49.727 --> 00:24:52.241
I'm sorry to bother you with this.


00:24:52.327 --> 00:24:53.646
It's no problem.


00:24:54.407 --> 00:24:58.639
We've all got to look out for each other.


00:25:00.087 --> 00:25:02.647
Dae-ho's coming to see me!


00:25:02.807 --> 00:25:04.286
Man-sik?


00:25:06.087 --> 00:25:08.317
You idiot!


00:25:10.087 --> 00:25:12.726
-Mom!
-I'm not your mom any more.


00:25:13.127 --> 00:25:16.244
You'll be the death of me, boy!


00:25:16.407 --> 00:25:18.363
Do I still have to wipe your ass too!


00:25:18.447 --> 00:25:20.324
Don't talk like that in front of my friends.


00:25:20.407 --> 00:25:24.036
If you like baseball that much,
shut down the restaurant!


00:25:24.247 --> 00:25:27.637
Starting tomorrow, just play ball then!


00:25:27.927 --> 00:25:30.122
Mom, you don't know a thing.


00:25:31.167 --> 00:25:33.635
We're Busan citizens, aren't we?


00:25:33.767 --> 00:25:36.918
A Giants victory should be
more important than our lives.


00:25:37.247 --> 00:25:39.841
Don't you know how to bow to your uncle?


00:25:42.687 --> 00:25:44.678
Anyway, he's one major human fuck-up.


00:25:44.767 --> 00:25:47.600
If I had a gun,
I'd have shot him on the spot.


00:25:49.607 --> 00:25:51.120
Hey, get me some food.


00:25:51.447 --> 00:25:54.280
Go to your own house and eat!
What am I, your wife?


00:25:58.567 --> 00:25:59.716
Where am I gonna go eat?


00:26:08.087 --> 00:26:09.600
From now on, don't borrow from anyone.


00:26:09.687 --> 00:26:11.598
And if you lend these out to someone else,
I'll be pissed.


00:26:11.687 --> 00:26:15.077
It's definitely blocked by something.
Don't think it'll work.


00:26:17.447 --> 00:26:18.596
Use my hands?


00:26:19.127 --> 00:26:20.196
Hello?


00:26:21.047 --> 00:26:22.116
Hello?


00:26:27.087 --> 00:26:29.601
How are preparations
for the event coming along?


00:26:29.687 --> 00:26:33.441
I'm not sure we'll be able
to even do the event right.


00:26:34.127 --> 00:26:35.401
It's that bad?


00:26:38.087 --> 00:26:39.918
Now it's going down just fine.


00:26:40.887 --> 00:26:43.560
What kind of luxury hotel
has clogged up drains?


00:26:44.327 --> 00:26:45.726
Thanks, anyway.


00:26:51.647 --> 00:26:53.239
What? Is there a problem?


00:26:53.527 --> 00:26:57.486
It's just that...


00:26:57.727 --> 00:26:59.445
The hotel isn't paying you?


00:26:59.567 --> 00:27:03.640
Usually I get my travel cost covered
on a late call.


00:27:06.207 --> 00:27:07.242
Hello!


00:27:07.327 --> 00:27:09.522
I'm sorry. Never mind!


00:27:13.807 --> 00:27:15.035
Unbelievable!


00:27:16.487 --> 00:27:20.036
Do you think this'll take
the water pressure?


00:27:20.247 --> 00:27:22.044
This measuring unit could have given


00:27:22.127 --> 00:27:24.721
early warning of the tsunami 5 years ago.


00:27:25.287 --> 00:27:26.720
-Are you ready?
-Yes.


00:27:28.047 --> 00:27:31.005
The only thing we can do is
counter-calculate Japan's figures


00:27:31.087 --> 00:27:32.679
and just take a wild guess.


00:27:32.767 --> 00:27:35.327
If we wait for the Japanese to act,
it's going to be too late.


00:27:35.407 --> 00:27:36.476
I agree.


00:27:36.687 --> 00:27:38.484
But do you think it'll work?


00:27:40.607 --> 00:27:43.724
Stop slacking, don't you want
to beat the Japanese to it?


00:27:45.167 --> 00:27:48.796
Stop crying
and answer the questions, okay?


00:27:49.167 --> 00:27:50.316
You sit down, boy!


00:27:50.407 --> 00:27:53.399
I came with my mom and her friend.


00:27:53.487 --> 00:27:55.523
Mom's friend? What about your dad?


00:27:55.887 --> 00:27:59.562
No, but I know Mom's phone number.


00:28:01.527 --> 00:28:05.042
We plan to restrict access
and have teatime here.


00:28:05.247 --> 00:28:09.160
Coming out into a space like this
will leave an impression.


00:28:09.727 --> 00:28:11.797
-Excuse me.
-When seeing this side...


00:28:12.247 --> 00:28:14.602
Yes. This is she.


00:28:17.287 --> 00:28:18.436
What?


00:28:18.527 --> 00:28:20.518
Incoming call: Yoo-jin


00:28:28.287 --> 00:28:29.322
Professor.


00:28:29.687 --> 00:28:32.201
We're getting continuous reports
of radon gas leaks!


00:28:32.287 --> 00:28:34.960
What?


00:28:37.167 --> 00:28:38.202
Hello?


00:28:41.127 --> 00:28:42.196
Ji-min!


00:28:49.487 --> 00:28:51.398
Are you Ji-min's guardian?


00:28:51.927 --> 00:28:52.962
Yes.


00:28:53.047 --> 00:28:55.242
She said that she didn't have a father.


00:28:55.887 --> 00:28:59.323
Her mom told me she'd be late
and asked me to come.


00:28:59.407 --> 00:29:01.477
Would you mind waiting here
for a moment?


00:29:01.567 --> 00:29:03.717
We can only hand her over
to the official guardian.


00:29:03.807 --> 00:29:04.876
I see.


00:29:17.287 --> 00:29:18.402
What's this?


00:29:19.087 --> 00:29:21.123
Use that to help you move your business.


00:29:21.207 --> 00:29:23.767
That's all right. No use trying this on me.


00:29:24.407 --> 00:29:26.602
People died on the Eok-jo,


00:29:26.767 --> 00:29:29.201
the families are all our members.


00:29:30.127 --> 00:29:33.563
No matter how much you offer,
they'll never leave their stores.


00:29:34.087 --> 00:29:35.679
Don't waste your energy.


00:29:36.767 --> 00:29:38.200
Was it all my fault?


00:29:38.287 --> 00:29:42.200
You forced the ship out of the port
knowing a typhoon was coming.


00:29:42.367 --> 00:29:43.846
The bodies weren't even found.


00:29:47.367 --> 00:29:49.164
What? Does it sting a little?


00:29:49.327 --> 00:29:50.919
Don't contact me again!


00:29:53.567 --> 00:29:56.559
Do you think you know
all there is to know about the world?


00:29:56.647 --> 00:29:58.080
Don't be fooled.


00:29:59.287 --> 00:30:03.758
The only reason I'm not forcing
anyone out is you and Yeon-hee.


00:30:04.767 --> 00:30:07.486
Go ahead and force us out then.


00:30:13.807 --> 00:30:15.877
You can't come in here.


00:30:15.967 --> 00:30:17.480
-Please leave!
-Let me just sell one.


00:30:18.607 --> 00:30:19.676
Did you have anything to eat?


00:30:21.287 --> 00:30:23.357
What do you want me to get for you?


00:30:24.847 --> 00:30:26.519
Excuse me!


00:30:26.607 --> 00:30:28.165
What can I offer you?


00:30:29.607 --> 00:30:31.279
Give us a kimbap and a doughnut.


00:30:31.367 --> 00:30:33.005
-All right.
-How much is that?


00:30:33.087 --> 00:30:34.440
4,000 won.


00:30:36.087 --> 00:30:38.601
-Keep the change.
-Thank you.


00:30:38.887 --> 00:30:41.401
-Thank you very much!
-Have a nice day.


00:30:44.927 --> 00:30:46.326
Thank you, officer!


00:30:47.967 --> 00:30:49.878
-Ji-min!
-Mommy!


00:30:52.407 --> 00:30:54.716
-What happened? You okay?
-I got lost.


00:30:54.847 --> 00:30:57.236
I told you to stay right next to Hae-chan!


00:30:57.767 --> 00:31:00.804
Why you gotta go get lost
and make me sick with worry?


00:31:01.007 --> 00:31:02.998
Hey, this is your doing!
You don't get to cry.


00:31:03.087 --> 00:31:05.362
Can't you see Mommy's busy working?


00:31:06.567 --> 00:31:07.682
Listen carefully!


00:31:07.767 --> 00:31:09.997
I don't care who you meet or who you date,


00:31:10.087 --> 00:31:11.679
but if something happens to her,


00:31:11.767 --> 00:31:13.598
I'm not gonna sit and watch.


00:31:14.927 --> 00:31:16.440
Now you're the father of the year,


00:31:16.527 --> 00:31:17.960
after all those years of not caring?


00:31:18.047 --> 00:31:19.526
-What?
-Don't worry about it!


00:31:19.607 --> 00:31:22.121
We won't be meeting
under these circumstances ever again.


00:31:22.207 --> 00:31:23.526
I've got to leave.


00:31:26.487 --> 00:31:27.636
Let's go.


00:31:29.087 --> 00:31:30.122
Thank you.


00:31:41.367 --> 00:31:43.801
If you were relocated,
you should have at least told me that!


00:31:43.887 --> 00:31:46.196
I spent my whole day looking for you!


00:31:46.767 --> 00:31:48.564
What are you doing? Come out!


00:31:50.567 --> 00:31:54.196
That's not going to be easy.


00:31:54.927 --> 00:31:56.724
We know each other too well.


00:31:57.487 --> 00:32:00.684
I'm asking you to do it
because it isn't going to be easy.


00:32:01.127 --> 00:32:03.163
You just have to persuade Man-sik.


00:32:04.207 --> 00:32:07.279
Don't worry about Man-sik.
I can handle him.


00:32:07.367 --> 00:32:09.722
All right, then
I won't say anything any more.


00:32:09.807 --> 00:32:11.206
If you handle this well,


00:32:11.287 --> 00:32:15.280
I'll make sure you get your own store.


00:32:25.047 --> 00:32:28.244
You're looking really pretty today.


00:32:29.887 --> 00:32:31.479
It took you long enough!


00:32:32.847 --> 00:32:34.803
It's about time you got married.


00:32:35.247 --> 00:32:38.159
Why don't you introduce me
to a good man first?


00:32:38.607 --> 00:32:39.676
Really?


00:32:40.487 --> 00:32:42.682
Should I find a guy for you?


00:32:42.927 --> 00:32:44.121
Enough of that!


00:32:44.207 --> 00:32:45.322
I'm serious.


00:32:45.607 --> 00:32:48.485
You know the chairman
of the fishing village, Jin-seung?


00:32:48.607 --> 00:32:50.802
He has a good education


00:32:50.927 --> 00:32:55.125
and his personality seems pretty good.


00:32:55.247 --> 00:32:56.726
Wanna give him a try?


00:32:57.007 --> 00:32:58.520
-Are you serious?
-Huh?


00:32:59.607 --> 00:33:01.120
Are you being serious?


00:33:01.567 --> 00:33:03.125
No, I mean...


00:33:03.847 --> 00:33:05.166
That's upsetting.


00:33:06.447 --> 00:33:08.915
Hey, bro!


00:33:09.327 --> 00:33:10.840
It's been a long time!


00:33:12.807 --> 00:33:15.037
It's time for you to clean up your act.


00:33:15.127 --> 00:33:17.357
You're getting old, aren't you worried?


00:33:17.727 --> 00:33:21.515
I'm actually planning
to start up my own business.


00:33:22.687 --> 00:33:26.999
That's why I'm here,
to ask Man-sik for some help.


00:33:28.687 --> 00:33:30.484
By the way,


00:33:30.727 --> 00:33:32.922
your father's memorial date is
coming close, right?


00:33:33.007 --> 00:33:35.840
You even remember
the date of my father's memorial?


00:33:36.967 --> 00:33:38.798
That's really touching.


00:33:38.887 --> 00:33:40.479
It's no big deal.


00:33:40.567 --> 00:33:42.239
I was at his side when he died,


00:33:42.327 --> 00:33:46.366
of course I remember the date.


00:33:47.727 --> 00:33:49.399
Thanks to Man-sik,


00:33:49.487 --> 00:33:51.955
we were on that fishing boat that day.


00:33:52.047 --> 00:33:53.162
Bugger off!


00:33:57.207 --> 00:33:59.675
What brought you to Haeundae?


00:34:00.047 --> 00:34:02.322
My name's not ''you''.


00:34:02.407 --> 00:34:03.840
It's Kim Hi-mi!


00:34:04.847 --> 00:34:07.486
And why do you ask
such cliché questions?


00:34:07.687 --> 00:34:10.884
I came to have a good time.


00:34:12.127 --> 00:34:15.119
You said that you go
to Ewha Women's University, right?


00:34:15.287 --> 00:34:18.563
-That's right.
-So, your major is...


00:34:18.687 --> 00:34:20.564
I'm going to be in the theatre programme.


00:34:20.647 --> 00:34:22.399
I mean, I'm in the programme.


00:34:22.807 --> 00:34:25.480
Then you must be good at acting.


00:34:25.727 --> 00:34:28.719
I'm not that great.


00:34:29.167 --> 00:34:30.282
You wanna see?


00:34:30.367 --> 00:34:31.925
No, that's all right.


00:34:40.727 --> 00:34:42.126
You son of a bitch!


00:34:43.807 --> 00:34:45.445
It's no use trying to persuade me!


00:34:45.527 --> 00:34:47.040
Is love just a game to you?


00:34:47.127 --> 00:34:49.436
You did everything to win me over


00:34:49.527 --> 00:34:51.006
and you're ending it?


00:34:51.287 --> 00:34:52.640
Are you human?


00:34:52.887 --> 00:34:54.240
Why are you doing this to me?


00:34:54.327 --> 00:34:55.999
I'm never giving up our baby!


00:34:56.087 --> 00:34:57.202
No, I can't!


00:34:58.047 --> 00:35:00.197
I will keep it!


00:35:00.767 --> 00:35:02.280
I'll raise it on my own.


00:35:02.367 --> 00:35:04.358
If you're going to go, just go!


00:35:04.727 --> 00:35:05.955
Get lost!


00:35:06.967 --> 00:35:08.400
My baby...


00:35:08.487 --> 00:35:10.443
No, it's not what it looks like.


00:35:11.487 --> 00:35:15.765
-I'm gonna kill myself.
-Please, don't!


00:35:20.647 --> 00:35:21.966
Let me have some.


00:35:28.527 --> 00:35:31.803
You're a big girl now!
Drinking booze and everything.


00:35:33.807 --> 00:35:35.718
Do you still see me as a child?


00:35:36.407 --> 00:35:37.920
If not, then what?


00:35:38.807 --> 00:35:40.763
See, that's why it won't work.


00:35:40.927 --> 00:35:41.996
What?


00:35:42.487 --> 00:35:43.761
Do you remember?


00:35:44.527 --> 00:35:45.596
What?


00:35:46.407 --> 00:35:48.637
When you came to see Dad


00:35:49.407 --> 00:35:51.363
on your first deep-sea vessel ride.


00:35:52.567 --> 00:35:54.000
Of course I remember!


00:35:54.087 --> 00:35:56.362
I was a freshman in high school then.


00:35:57.207 --> 00:35:58.686
Was it that long ago?


00:35:59.287 --> 00:36:01.517
You didn't see me before you left, right?


00:36:01.607 --> 00:36:02.835
Were you home then?


00:36:02.927 --> 00:36:04.599
-Yeah.
-Really?


00:36:05.047 --> 00:36:08.642
But I was too shy to come out of my room.


00:36:09.287 --> 00:36:10.959
-Why?
-I don't know.


00:36:11.687 --> 00:36:13.757
I guess I was going through puberty.


00:36:14.087 --> 00:36:16.760
Whenever I saw you,
my heart would beat so fast.


00:36:18.447 --> 00:36:19.516
Your heart?


00:36:29.687 --> 00:36:31.484
What are you up to tomorrow?


00:36:32.007 --> 00:36:33.679
Tomorrow? Why?


00:36:34.167 --> 00:36:36.601
Would you like to come with me
to my dad's grave site?


00:36:36.687 --> 00:36:38.723
I need to trim the grass around it


00:36:38.847 --> 00:36:40.565
before the memorial ritual.


00:36:43.127 --> 00:36:46.039
Sure. I'll go with you.


00:37:11.127 --> 00:37:13.641
Fix the cage, right now!


00:37:13.727 --> 00:37:17.276
Man-sik! You have to grab this one first!


00:37:17.367 --> 00:37:18.959
This is the one that we have to fix first!


00:37:19.127 --> 00:37:20.640
If you undo that one,


00:37:20.727 --> 00:37:22.365
the anchor will break!


00:37:22.447 --> 00:37:24.802
On land, you're the elder.


00:37:24.927 --> 00:37:26.485
But out here, I'm your boss.


00:37:26.567 --> 00:37:28.205
Just do as I say!


00:37:28.487 --> 00:37:29.886
Don't you see that?


00:37:29.967 --> 00:37:32.242
You've got to release this right now.


00:37:32.447 --> 00:37:34.199
Why do you keep talking?


00:37:34.487 --> 00:37:36.125
Just do what I say!


00:37:36.207 --> 00:37:37.765
What are you doing?


00:37:37.847 --> 00:37:38.882
Aren't you gonna help?


00:37:41.927 --> 00:37:44.680
Don't go there!


00:37:44.767 --> 00:37:47.725
We don't have time! Hurry up!


00:37:47.807 --> 00:37:49.286
Don't pull that!


00:38:07.527 --> 00:38:09.643
Daddy, I'm scared.


00:38:17.127 --> 00:38:18.446
It's all right.


00:38:21.607 --> 00:38:22.835
It's all right.


00:38:24.847 --> 00:38:27.919
You're still mad at me? Christ!


00:38:34.607 --> 00:38:36.404
That's an interesting watch.


00:38:36.527 --> 00:38:38.722
-Can I have it?
-What?


00:38:39.407 --> 00:38:42.240
Wanna switch with me?
Mine is a really expensive one.


00:38:42.327 --> 00:38:44.636
No way. I really need this on rescue.


00:38:44.727 --> 00:38:46.365
All right, I don't want it.


00:38:46.647 --> 00:38:49.207
Do you know what they call
people like you?


00:38:49.687 --> 00:38:51.837
No, what?


00:38:52.087 --> 00:38:54.123
-You're just like 3 o'clock!
-What?


00:38:55.407 --> 00:38:58.319
You're very borderline.
Just like 3 in the afternoon.


00:38:58.407 --> 00:39:00.318
Too late to go anywhere


00:39:00.607 --> 00:39:02.837
but a waste not to do anything.


00:39:04.847 --> 00:39:06.166
What do you mean?


00:39:11.087 --> 00:39:12.156
What?


00:39:13.927 --> 00:39:17.522
Wait! Don't! Don't! Let go of me!


00:39:17.607 --> 00:39:20.679
Just stay there like that!


00:39:21.167 --> 00:39:22.998
Oh, my God! Crazy bitch!


00:39:23.407 --> 00:39:26.877
-I'm so embarrassed.
-The ''off to Seoul'' Hi-mi is here in Busan.


00:39:27.207 --> 00:39:28.925
Maybe her identical twin?


00:39:30.087 --> 00:39:31.566
Slow it down!


00:39:53.847 --> 00:39:56.759
The figures are too similar to 2004
for it to be just a coincidence.


00:39:56.847 --> 00:40:00.806
In 2004, the epicentre continued
to move to the right just like this.


00:40:01.007 --> 00:40:02.406
Starting 6 months before the tsunami,


00:40:02.487 --> 00:40:05.399
we measured instances of earthquakes
at a depth of 30 km on the sea floor.


00:40:05.487 --> 00:40:07.284
How many earthquakes has it been
so far this year?


00:40:07.367 --> 00:40:08.880
More than 50.


00:40:09.007 --> 00:40:10.759
Before the Southeast Asia tsunami,
it was over 50 as well.


00:40:10.847 --> 00:40:11.996
What's the median severity?


00:40:12.087 --> 00:40:13.315
3.0.


00:40:13.687 --> 00:40:15.962
There's been another
earthquake on the sea floor!


00:40:16.047 --> 00:40:17.765
-Where?
-East of Tsushima Island!


00:40:17.847 --> 00:40:19.599
-What's the magnitude?
-5.6.


00:40:20.047 --> 00:40:21.560
They're getting bigger.


00:40:24.367 --> 00:40:25.436
Sir.


00:40:25.567 --> 00:40:27.159
This is a serious situation.


00:40:27.247 --> 00:40:28.726
This is really serious.


00:40:29.247 --> 00:40:30.316
Look.


00:40:30.407 --> 00:40:32.557
There's a million gathered
at Haeundae right now.


00:40:32.647 --> 00:40:34.558
If a tsunami hits
under such circumstances...


00:40:34.647 --> 00:40:37.957
Are there any chances
of a tsunami hitting Korea?


00:40:38.167 --> 00:40:39.839
I have never heard about
something like that.


00:40:40.167 --> 00:40:43.239
How many earthquakes you think
occur around Korea per year?


00:40:43.327 --> 00:40:44.919
About 3 or 4?


00:40:45.007 --> 00:40:47.396
30 of more than 3.0 in intensity.


00:40:47.767 --> 00:40:49.758
So far this year, we've already had 50.


00:40:49.847 --> 00:40:53.681
And what's more important is the
epicentre's moving closer to Korea.


00:40:53.887 --> 00:40:55.798
If Tsushima Island,


00:40:56.127 --> 00:40:58.243
between Korea and Japan, collapses,


00:40:58.807 --> 00:41:00.559
the chances of a mega-tsunami
are extremely high.


00:41:00.647 --> 00:41:01.875
A mega-tsunami?


00:41:06.767 --> 00:41:08.917
Let's say that the bubbles are


00:41:09.047 --> 00:41:12.596
about the size of a wave that would arise
in the event of an earthquake.


00:41:12.687 --> 00:41:15.485
If the western part of Tsushima
sinks into the water,


00:41:15.567 --> 00:41:19.116
the shock from that would create
a wave of an unimaginable height.


00:41:19.207 --> 00:41:20.799
That is a mega-tsunami.


00:41:21.287 --> 00:41:24.324
The waves of the 2004 tsunami
were 3 to 4 metres.


00:41:24.487 --> 00:41:26.000
If Tsushima Island collapses,


00:41:26.087 --> 00:41:27.486
the waves will top 50 metres.


00:41:27.567 --> 00:41:28.966
Is that a real possibility?


00:41:29.047 --> 00:41:31.163
I'm talking about a minimum of 50 metres.


00:41:31.247 --> 00:41:32.965
A wave over 100 metres is possible.


00:41:33.047 --> 00:41:35.720
Then what is it we've got to do to prepare?


00:41:36.207 --> 00:41:37.686
If the tsunami warning goes off,


00:41:37.767 --> 00:41:39.758
we've got to evacuate people
within 10 minutes.


00:41:39.847 --> 00:41:42.680
Within that amount of time?


00:41:43.047 --> 00:41:46.562
A tsunami causes a tidal wave
that travels 700 km per hour.


00:41:46.647 --> 00:41:47.682
700 km?


00:41:47.767 --> 00:41:49.405
If a tsunami starts at Tsushima,


00:41:49.487 --> 00:41:52.081
-to get to Haeundae it would take...
-How long?


00:41:52.327 --> 00:41:54.602
Less than 10 minutes!


00:41:59.967 --> 00:42:01.798
Did you fight with my father?


00:42:01.927 --> 00:42:03.406
What are you doing there?


00:42:04.207 --> 00:42:05.799
-Get over here.
-All right.


00:42:08.847 --> 00:42:11.441
Father,


00:42:12.327 --> 00:42:16.240
I brought your favourite,
Man-sik, here with me.


00:42:17.487 --> 00:42:20.160
I wanted to tell you


00:42:21.527 --> 00:42:23.757
something very important today,


00:42:24.847 --> 00:42:26.439
so I brought him.


00:42:28.047 --> 00:42:30.641
He's taken care of me so well.


00:42:31.087 --> 00:42:33.726
Now I wanna return the favour.


00:42:35.807 --> 00:42:37.126
Sometimes,


00:42:38.047 --> 00:42:40.561
he even takes care of me
better than you did.


00:42:43.327 --> 00:42:45.283
Well,


00:42:46.367 --> 00:42:48.642
I keep dropping hints but


00:42:49.207 --> 00:42:51.402
that dullard never gets it.


00:42:54.247 --> 00:42:56.602
So I've been a little frustrated lately.


00:42:59.287 --> 00:43:04.156
But I can't just bare my heart to him first.


00:43:05.327 --> 00:43:06.726
I don't wanna lose face.


00:43:08.407 --> 00:43:13.800
So you coach that man over there.


00:43:15.327 --> 00:43:18.319
You were always popular with the ladies.


00:43:22.047 --> 00:43:25.596
Hey, you listen to what
my father tells you, all right?


00:43:25.967 --> 00:43:27.559
I'll be back in a sec.


00:43:57.007 --> 00:43:58.599
How are you holding up?


00:44:07.087 --> 00:44:09.078
I'm so sorry.


00:44:12.407 --> 00:44:13.522
I'm sorry.


00:44:17.327 --> 00:44:18.476
I'm so sorry.


00:44:29.127 --> 00:44:30.446
What do you mean?


00:44:31.807 --> 00:44:32.876
What if


00:44:35.327 --> 00:44:36.476
in the future,


00:44:37.927 --> 00:44:40.805
Yeon-hee became my wife?
How would you feel?


00:44:41.647 --> 00:44:43.239
How much did you drink?


00:44:44.967 --> 00:44:46.639
Show some respect.


00:44:46.807 --> 00:44:48.081
Are you serious?


00:44:52.647 --> 00:44:56.196
Listen carefully. If there's a girl from Seoul


00:44:57.167 --> 00:44:59.078
who goes to a good university


00:45:00.167 --> 00:45:01.646
and is so hot


00:45:02.207 --> 00:45:03.799
and from a rich family,


00:45:05.087 --> 00:45:08.238
could I go out with a girl like that?
That make any sense?


00:45:08.327 --> 00:45:09.442
It does not.


00:45:10.487 --> 00:45:12.284
Right? It doesn't, does it?


00:45:14.527 --> 00:45:16.006
Don't drink too much.


00:45:24.247 --> 00:45:25.885
Think about it carefully.


00:45:26.127 --> 00:45:27.845
What Yeon-hee's father's


00:45:28.807 --> 00:45:30.399
last words were.


00:45:41.647 --> 00:45:45.356
Run to the restaurant in 10 minutes,
or you'll be dead and so will I.


00:45:51.407 --> 00:45:52.806
Can I be out for


00:45:53.647 --> 00:45:55.399
about an hour?


00:45:55.487 --> 00:45:56.522
Where are you going this time?


00:45:56.607 --> 00:45:59.917
I have an important appointment.


00:46:03.647 --> 00:46:04.841
Choi Hyung-sik?


00:46:24.047 --> 00:46:26.720
The fireworks display
of the World Culture Expo.


00:46:28.687 --> 00:46:30.006
You're a natural.


00:46:30.967 --> 00:46:33.322
How many girls did you get with that act?


00:46:34.367 --> 00:46:36.164
But I cannot forgive you


00:46:36.887 --> 00:46:38.479
for flirting with my fiancé.


00:46:38.767 --> 00:46:39.836
What?


00:46:44.727 --> 00:46:47.844
You should know who she's with
before you flirt with her.


00:46:48.407 --> 00:46:51.001
She's not the kind of girl within your reach.


00:46:58.527 --> 00:47:01.087
You're a real classy guy.


00:47:05.607 --> 00:47:08.167
I hope this is the last time that I see you.


00:47:08.687 --> 00:47:10.245
If I catch you again,


00:47:10.647 --> 00:47:13.115
I'll beat the shit out of you.


00:47:16.367 --> 00:47:18.483
You look as if something good
has just happened to you.


00:47:18.567 --> 00:47:20.239
Yep, that's right.


00:47:20.327 --> 00:47:21.521
What happened?


00:47:21.967 --> 00:47:23.116
Today finally,


00:47:23.447 --> 00:47:27.679
Mipo Golden Beach has been approved.


00:47:30.527 --> 00:47:33.405
But you don't need to worry about it.


00:47:34.007 --> 00:47:36.475
I promised your dad I'd take care of you.


00:47:37.687 --> 00:47:40.724
Drop by my office tomorrow,


00:47:40.967 --> 00:47:43.800
I'll set you up with a good spot.


00:47:44.047 --> 00:47:46.117
No, that's all right.


00:47:46.447 --> 00:47:50.156
You've already helped me out a lot.


00:47:56.007 --> 00:47:57.326
You leaving now?


00:47:58.007 --> 00:47:59.122
Do you want me to call a taxi?


00:47:59.207 --> 00:48:01.926
No, no. I'm fine.


00:48:02.447 --> 00:48:03.516
Eok-jo!


00:48:04.807 --> 00:48:07.799
I will send the rent fee for the boat
in a few days.


00:48:08.847 --> 00:48:11.600
I don't spare money when it comes to you,


00:48:12.607 --> 00:48:14.563
so don't work too hard for money.


00:48:16.207 --> 00:48:18.801
All right. Goodbye.


00:48:29.887 --> 00:48:31.798
Why did that old man come here?


00:48:31.887 --> 00:48:33.684
Just to have dinner.


00:48:33.767 --> 00:48:35.166
Don't serve him next time.


00:48:35.247 --> 00:48:36.919
He pisses me off.


00:48:37.127 --> 00:48:39.243
-What brings you so late?
-Oh, right!


00:48:46.087 --> 00:48:47.884
What's the special occasion?


00:48:48.687 --> 00:48:49.836
Wait a second.


00:49:04.927 --> 00:49:05.996
Yeon-hee!


00:49:07.127 --> 00:49:09.482
I love you!


00:49:10.887 --> 00:49:13.321
I want you to be the mother of my children!


00:49:14.687 --> 00:49:16.086
What are you doing?


00:49:19.367 --> 00:49:20.766
I'm proposing.


00:49:22.487 --> 00:49:24.125
Why aren't you answering?


00:49:24.647 --> 00:49:26.763
-Answer what?
-Say you will marry me.


00:49:27.447 --> 00:49:28.846
Let me think about it...


00:49:28.927 --> 00:49:30.042
Think about what?


00:49:30.127 --> 00:49:32.197
You have to give me time to think.


00:49:32.327 --> 00:49:35.285
If it's a yes, it's a yes.


00:49:35.727 --> 00:49:37.683
What's there to think about?


00:49:38.647 --> 00:49:42.003
Early tomorrow morning,
come to my restaurant.


00:49:43.007 --> 00:49:46.079
If there is a red ribbon tied
to my boat, it's a yes.


00:49:46.407 --> 00:49:50.400
-Don't expect too much, though.
-Why don't you just give me an answer?


00:49:53.927 --> 00:49:55.758
Come, look!


00:51:00.807 --> 00:51:04.117
Are you playing with me?
I have been waiting for you all day.


00:51:04.567 --> 00:51:07.445
If you can't keep promises,
you shouldn't make them.


00:51:07.887 --> 00:51:11.357
And if you can't keep a promise,
you should at least explain why.


00:51:11.727 --> 00:51:14.161
Hey. Are you going to keep ignoring me?


00:51:14.887 --> 00:51:15.956
Hey, you!


00:51:22.807 --> 00:51:23.876
Hey!


00:51:25.647 --> 00:51:27.444
Don't fool around with me.


00:51:30.527 --> 00:51:32.836
Don't come to see me.


00:51:33.567 --> 00:51:35.444
I don't want to see you again.


00:51:35.647 --> 00:51:37.046
What?


00:51:39.727 --> 00:51:40.796
What?


00:51:41.967 --> 00:51:43.685
Interview?


00:51:44.087 --> 00:51:45.884
It's a small company,


00:51:46.047 --> 00:51:47.924
but the salary's almost 2 million won.


00:51:48.007 --> 00:51:49.918
I had a really hard time getting
someone I know to arrange it.


00:51:50.007 --> 00:51:52.919
Stop it. How can I be doing
job interviews at my age?


00:51:53.007 --> 00:51:56.204
Are you going to live
without a job for your entire life?


00:51:56.287 --> 00:51:58.517
Who said I would be jobless
for the rest of my life?


00:51:58.607 --> 00:52:00.962
Stubborn jackass!


00:52:01.807 --> 00:52:04.321
Anyway, I won't go.
Don't try to persuade me.


00:52:06.247 --> 00:52:09.239
I'm begging you.


00:52:09.327 --> 00:52:12.444
I don't even have
an acceptable pair of shoes.


00:52:14.567 --> 00:52:16.398
Will you go if I buy you shoes?


00:52:16.487 --> 00:52:19.479
Just forget about it!


00:52:21.727 --> 00:52:23.843
Why is it so hard for you
to go to a job interview?


00:52:23.927 --> 00:52:25.485
Go and try, at least.


00:52:25.567 --> 00:52:27.603
Why don't you go?


00:52:27.767 --> 00:52:29.405
I'm too old for that.


00:52:29.527 --> 00:52:32.678
That attitude is the reason
you don't have a woman.


00:52:32.767 --> 00:52:35.918
Shit. I'll burn your mouth.


00:52:36.087 --> 00:52:38.442
Moron, you say that all the time.


00:52:39.607 --> 00:52:42.121
My skin doesn't look right.


00:52:43.887 --> 00:52:46.560
Are you insane?
Why are you in such a good mood?


00:52:46.887 --> 00:52:48.525
Why? Do you want to know?


00:52:49.087 --> 00:52:50.156
No way!


00:52:50.367 --> 00:52:51.436
Do you want me to tell you?


00:52:51.527 --> 00:52:53.563
I didn't say I want to know.


00:52:54.007 --> 00:52:55.440
In fact...


00:52:56.007 --> 00:52:58.680
Today, Man-sik proposed to me!


00:52:59.567 --> 00:53:01.080
-What?
-Isn't it funny?


00:53:01.647 --> 00:53:03.444
I was so shocked.


00:53:04.207 --> 00:53:05.481
I'm embarrassed.


00:53:06.727 --> 00:53:11.926
Why? Do you feel jealous?


00:53:14.327 --> 00:53:16.716
-This just isn't right.
-What do you mean?


00:53:19.047 --> 00:53:20.685
What's he thinking?


00:53:20.927 --> 00:53:22.360
What are you saying?


00:53:26.207 --> 00:53:28.323
Do you know how your dad passed away?


00:53:30.087 --> 00:53:31.964
We've got major problems here.


00:53:32.287 --> 00:53:34.357
The path of the typhoon
has already shifted toward us,


00:53:34.447 --> 00:53:37.678
and underwater earthquakes are
occurring once every 2 days.


00:53:37.767 --> 00:53:39.837
Another earthquake happened
off the shore of Tsushima Island!


00:53:39.927 --> 00:53:41.918
This time, it's 6.5.


00:53:42.007 --> 00:53:44.043
Doctor! We are connected to Japan!


00:53:45.807 --> 00:53:47.081
This is Kim Hwi.


00:53:47.687 --> 00:53:50.042
What? Has a tsunami warning
already been issued?


00:53:50.127 --> 00:53:52.118
Under sea near Tsushima Island


00:54:06.887 --> 00:54:09.082
What are you doing here?


00:54:09.287 --> 00:54:10.356
Nothing.


00:54:10.447 --> 00:54:11.766
You must be waiting for Yeon-hee,


00:54:11.847 --> 00:54:13.963
but she won't be coming.


00:54:14.847 --> 00:54:16.599
What?


00:54:18.207 --> 00:54:22.405
Thanks to you, Eok-jo cussed me out.


00:54:22.727 --> 00:54:26.197
You act like you don't care
about justice at all,


00:54:32.007 --> 00:54:34.237
so I told her the truth!


00:54:34.887 --> 00:54:38.516
Since I was a kid,
my nickname was the guardian of justice.


00:54:39.607 --> 00:54:41.165
You son of a bitch!


00:54:44.847 --> 00:54:45.996
You get here!


00:54:46.087 --> 00:54:48.885
You scumbag!


00:54:55.047 --> 00:54:57.003
You killed her dad. Isn't it true?


00:54:57.087 --> 00:54:59.726
Take your hand off!


00:55:23.847 --> 00:55:24.962
What?


00:55:25.487 --> 00:55:26.840
Has he gone crazy?


00:55:27.487 --> 00:55:29.318
Wait up. I'm coming right now.


00:55:30.887 --> 00:55:34.357
What are you talking about? How can
we evacuate one million people right now?


00:55:34.527 --> 00:55:36.643
On top of that,
the Culture Expo opened today.


00:55:36.727 --> 00:55:39.639
If we put a halt to it,
we'll be the world's laughingstock!


00:55:39.727 --> 00:55:41.718
Do you want all the people here to die?


00:55:41.807 --> 00:55:44.037
In Japan, the cautionary warning
has already been issued.


00:55:44.127 --> 00:55:47.039
In Japan, earthquakes happen a lot.


00:55:47.167 --> 00:55:49.317
Do you have proof a tsunami
will be coming here?


00:55:49.407 --> 00:55:52.956
Last night's 6.5 earthquake
occurred near Tsushima Island.


00:55:53.207 --> 00:55:55.721
There is a high chance
a stronger earthquake will hit soon.


00:55:55.807 --> 00:55:58.685
Moreover, if an earthquake over 7.0
occurs off the shore of Tsushima,


00:55:58.767 --> 00:56:00.325
Haeundae will be in grave danger.


00:56:00.407 --> 00:56:04.195
Didn't you see what happened
in Southeast Asia? 300,000 died in an hour!


00:56:04.287 --> 00:56:05.879
You're driving me crazy.


00:56:06.127 --> 00:56:09.278
Why are you doing this to me?
Do you want to ruin my life?


00:56:10.247 --> 00:56:11.726
I never wanted to interrupt your work!


00:56:11.807 --> 00:56:13.684
I just told them because it is
a terribly dangerous situation.


00:56:13.767 --> 00:56:16.759
For the last year,
I've been risking my career over this!


00:56:16.847 --> 00:56:19.281
You think you are the only one
who is working? I do too!


00:56:19.367 --> 00:56:22.439
Even if you try to get in my way,
I will continue.


00:56:22.727 --> 00:56:24.206
I'm not ignoring you,


00:56:24.367 --> 00:56:26.801
so just calm down.
Why don't you send Ji-min to Seoul first.


00:56:26.887 --> 00:56:28.479
Don't boss me around.


00:56:28.567 --> 00:56:29.795
I'll handle Ji-min on my own.


00:56:29.887 --> 00:56:32.242
She's with that strange jerk, isn't she?


00:56:32.527 --> 00:56:36.202
Watch your mouth.
He is more reliable than you'll ever be!


00:56:36.327 --> 00:56:41.037
Stay out of my life, all right?


00:57:34.447 --> 00:57:36.085
What are you doing?


00:57:36.727 --> 00:57:38.206
You guys go on ahead.


00:57:38.327 --> 00:57:40.079
I can't go today.


00:57:40.167 --> 00:57:43.159
What? You've already come all this way.


00:57:43.967 --> 00:57:45.286
Next time!


00:57:54.927 --> 00:57:56.280
Oh, come on in.


00:57:57.127 --> 00:57:59.197
You brought your legal seal, right?


00:57:59.967 --> 00:58:01.685
What are you talking about?


00:58:03.607 --> 00:58:05.120
I don't need a store.


00:58:06.047 --> 00:58:07.116
Why?


00:58:08.447 --> 00:58:10.915
I've been thinking about it since yesterday.


00:58:12.207 --> 00:58:18.237
You, my father and I are all
people of Haeundae.


00:58:20.007 --> 00:58:22.965
Everyone here is like family to me.


00:58:24.887 --> 00:58:29.403
Even if I get a new store and live off of it,


00:58:30.687 --> 00:58:32.678
Dad would not be happy.


00:58:33.927 --> 00:58:35.804
Please consider Man-sik,


00:58:37.847 --> 00:58:39.678
and think it over once again.


00:58:41.407 --> 00:58:43.079
I'm asking you as a favour.


00:58:47.487 --> 00:58:48.920
I'll be leaving now.


00:58:55.287 --> 00:58:56.686
And I...


00:58:58.407 --> 00:59:00.318
I'm leaving Haeundae next week.


00:59:26.367 --> 00:59:27.959
Come on, Hi-mi!


00:59:50.127 --> 00:59:52.118
Let's go to the hot spring.


01:00:23.287 --> 01:00:25.278
West of Tsushima Island


01:00:44.847 --> 01:00:46.280
We can't wait any longer.


01:00:46.367 --> 01:00:48.039
First, we have to evacuate
the people on the beach.


01:00:48.127 --> 01:00:49.606
What are you talking about?


01:00:49.687 --> 01:00:51.359
There's been no directive yet.


01:00:51.447 --> 01:00:53.483
This is not the time for us
to just wait around for directives.


01:00:53.567 --> 01:00:54.636
Something's not right here.


01:00:54.727 --> 01:00:57.116
If we issue an evacuation order
and nothing happens,


01:00:57.207 --> 01:00:59.277
will you take the responsibility for it?


01:01:01.767 --> 01:01:04.042
Director! I've got the order


01:01:04.207 --> 01:01:07.199
to issue the tsunami warning
and clear out immediately!


01:01:08.007 --> 01:01:09.076
What?


01:01:11.927 --> 01:01:15.522
Hurry! Issue the warning
and make an announcement now.


01:01:19.047 --> 01:01:22.756
Haeundae has
one of the biggest beaches in Asia


01:01:22.847 --> 01:01:24.678
along with Dongbaek Island, Moonrise Hill,


01:01:24.767 --> 01:01:26.997
Hot spring, Oryuk Island.


01:01:27.287 --> 01:01:29.403
Busan,


01:01:30.047 --> 01:01:33.039
an internationally recognised
tourist attraction,


01:01:33.327 --> 01:01:36.797
incomparable to any other city
in its cultural diversity.


01:01:37.087 --> 01:01:42.115
Also, as a port city, it has strived
to expand cultural...


01:02:01.407 --> 01:02:04.240
Could you wrap up here?
I have to go check on Ji-min.


01:02:07.407 --> 01:02:09.398
35 km east of Haeundae


01:02:12.087 --> 01:02:13.805
Where are you now?


01:02:14.207 --> 01:02:16.926
I am going to get my car repaired. Why?


01:02:17.647 --> 01:02:19.160
What's your shoe size?


01:02:19.527 --> 01:02:22.087
Shoes?


01:02:22.247 --> 01:02:24.397
You didn't take the picnic bus?


01:02:24.727 --> 01:02:26.957
Just answer the question.


01:02:27.207 --> 01:02:28.322
What size is it?


01:02:28.407 --> 01:02:31.126
Whatever. I'm really busy right now.


01:02:34.807 --> 01:02:36.240
Do you like fishing?


01:02:36.327 --> 01:02:38.795
Did you plan this? All part of your scheme?


01:02:39.727 --> 01:02:43.276
No, I'm just going by the plan
your friends came up with.


01:02:45.127 --> 01:02:46.526
Those losers.


01:02:47.127 --> 01:02:50.278
-They must be having a good time, right?
-Don't worry. It's over now.


01:02:50.367 --> 01:02:55.157
100? 100! Joon-ha always wins.


01:02:55.287 --> 01:02:56.402
That bitch is so lucky.


01:02:56.487 --> 01:02:59.081
You sound a little emotional about it.


01:02:59.167 --> 01:03:02.682
No, I'm not. I'm going to the restroom.


01:03:13.487 --> 01:03:17.002
Yeon-hee... I will explain everything.


01:03:18.487 --> 01:03:20.364
Can I just be alone today?


01:03:21.807 --> 01:03:23.525
You can if you want, but...


01:03:26.727 --> 01:03:30.402
An earthquake warning was


01:03:30.807 --> 01:03:34.356
issued as of 2:30 p.m.


01:03:34.607 --> 01:03:37.724
Everyone on the beach should
seek high ground immediately.


01:03:42.247 --> 01:03:43.919
As of 2:30 p.m...


01:04:17.727 --> 01:04:18.796
What's wrong with you?


01:04:37.887 --> 01:04:39.878
20 km east of Haeundae


01:04:43.487 --> 01:04:46.285
Check out the situation in Japan right now.
How's the evacuation situation?


01:04:46.367 --> 01:04:49.564
We're preparing for it now. It is not easy
to clear out a crowd of one million.


01:04:49.647 --> 01:04:51.126
Doctor! It's serious.


01:04:51.447 --> 01:04:53.483
They're saying a tsunami is coming
toward Korea now.


01:04:53.567 --> 01:04:54.886
-The estimated time?
-Around 10 minutes.


01:04:54.967 --> 01:04:56.366
-Height?
-We have yet to...


01:04:56.447 --> 01:04:58.403
Go and check it out immediately!


01:05:01.127 --> 01:05:02.196
Hello!


01:05:02.727 --> 01:05:03.876
Where is she?


01:05:04.367 --> 01:05:05.402
What?


01:05:05.807 --> 01:05:07.923
I told you to take good care of her.


01:05:08.647 --> 01:05:13.163
First of all, get all the people
to high ground in 10 minutes.


01:05:14.607 --> 01:05:15.642
Where are you going?


01:05:15.727 --> 01:05:17.080
I'll be back soon.


01:05:18.247 --> 01:05:20.238
15 km east of Haeundae


01:05:26.087 --> 01:05:28.123
What are you going to do?


01:05:29.727 --> 01:05:33.515
Can't you see that cracked front screen?


01:05:33.607 --> 01:05:35.040
Uncle Dong-choon!


01:05:37.727 --> 01:05:42.084
Well... We left Sooyoung Bay
2 hours ago...


01:05:42.287 --> 01:05:43.800
Where the hell are we!


01:06:15.487 --> 01:06:16.556
Mommy!


01:06:19.567 --> 01:06:20.886
Anyone out there?


01:06:23.567 --> 01:06:24.636
Hello!


01:06:24.727 --> 01:06:26.206
Which room is she in?


01:06:26.847 --> 01:06:28.041
The 17th floor, room 1.


01:06:28.127 --> 01:06:29.242
Room one on the 17th? Okay.


01:06:29.327 --> 01:06:31.158
Where are you?


01:06:31.367 --> 01:06:32.925
I'm nearby. I had a problem.


01:06:33.007 --> 01:06:35.919
Anyway, you need to get to a high building!


01:06:36.247 --> 01:06:37.316
What?


01:06:37.407 --> 01:06:39.159
A tsunami is headed straight
for Haeundae now.


01:07:16.247 --> 01:07:17.316
Man-sik...


01:07:34.047 --> 01:07:35.241
What's that?


01:07:52.087 --> 01:07:53.281
Help! Rescue us!


01:08:48.967 --> 01:08:50.685
Uncle! Grandma!


01:08:52.447 --> 01:08:55.120
Ma'am! Ma'am!


01:10:53.247 --> 01:10:56.284
Hurry! Hurry!


01:10:56.607 --> 01:10:58.006
There! Over there!


01:10:58.087 --> 01:10:59.202
Help!


01:10:59.287 --> 01:11:02.518
Rescue ship found.
We will begin rescue work right away.


01:11:05.407 --> 01:11:08.479
Hello! Is anyone here? Hello!


01:11:32.087 --> 01:11:34.078
Man-sik!


01:11:35.847 --> 01:11:37.565
Yeon-hee!


01:12:05.887 --> 01:12:07.036
Seung-hyun!


01:12:09.087 --> 01:12:10.202
Ma'am!


01:12:10.287 --> 01:12:11.356
Help!


01:12:12.447 --> 01:12:13.516
Basket!


01:12:13.967 --> 01:12:15.036
What basket?


01:12:15.527 --> 01:12:16.960
Basket, you moron!


01:12:17.247 --> 01:12:19.477
I heard there are only 2 here.


01:12:19.567 --> 01:12:20.602
I just brought a safety belt.


01:12:20.687 --> 01:12:21.961
You fucking idiot!


01:12:23.727 --> 01:12:25.843
-Throw it quickly.
-All right!


01:12:26.327 --> 01:12:27.965
Help! Nobody there?


01:12:32.447 --> 01:12:34.005
Seung-hyun!


01:12:34.087 --> 01:12:36.555
Have you seen a little kid?


01:13:56.567 --> 01:13:57.636
Man-sik!


01:14:01.087 --> 01:14:02.645
Yeon-hee! Climb up!


01:14:02.727 --> 01:14:04.080
Quickly!


01:14:04.167 --> 01:14:05.236
Hurry!


01:14:07.487 --> 01:14:08.556
I'm fine. You go first.


01:14:08.647 --> 01:14:12.720
Stop talking and just do it.


01:14:12.847 --> 01:14:16.886
Step on my shoulders and get up there fast!


01:14:19.447 --> 01:14:21.642
We don't have time.


01:15:15.327 --> 01:15:17.318
Ji-min!


01:15:17.407 --> 01:15:20.638
Help! Help! Help!


01:15:20.847 --> 01:15:21.996
Ji-min!


01:15:30.087 --> 01:15:31.884
Ji-min!


01:15:31.967 --> 01:15:34.037
Hold my hand tight.


01:15:34.167 --> 01:15:35.998
Ji-min!


01:15:45.447 --> 01:15:47.324
Nobody out there?


01:15:51.847 --> 01:15:53.166
One by one!


01:15:54.047 --> 01:15:57.164
You son of a bitch!


01:15:59.647 --> 01:16:01.126
Hi-mi.


01:16:08.407 --> 01:16:11.319
Hyung-sik!


01:16:14.807 --> 01:16:16.525
Good job, good job.


01:16:16.687 --> 01:16:18.723
Are you okay?


01:16:18.807 --> 01:16:22.277
Arms! Arms! Okay!


01:16:22.767 --> 01:16:24.405
You first!


01:16:24.487 --> 01:16:26.682
-What about you?
-I'll take him and go.


01:16:26.767 --> 01:16:31.283
-Coming right back?
-Yeah. Let me ask one thing.


01:16:31.367 --> 01:16:33.961
-What?
-Are you really engaged to him?


01:16:34.167 --> 01:16:37.000
What? We barely know each other.


01:16:37.087 --> 01:16:38.725
That bastard!


01:16:40.447 --> 01:16:42.881
Go ahead.


01:16:42.967 --> 01:16:44.400
Roll up!


01:16:46.127 --> 01:16:47.401
Come up quickly, okay?


01:16:47.767 --> 01:16:49.678
You got that?


01:17:03.367 --> 01:17:04.641
Hello? Where are you?


01:17:05.447 --> 01:17:07.039
I'm fine. What about Ji-min?


01:17:07.127 --> 01:17:08.845
I'm with her on the roof.


01:17:10.727 --> 01:17:12.638
Where are you?


01:17:12.727 --> 01:17:14.160
Tell me where you are!


01:17:14.367 --> 01:17:16.244
-Inside the elevator.
-What?


01:17:16.327 --> 01:17:18.204
I'm stuck in the hotel elevator.


01:17:18.287 --> 01:17:19.402
Which floor?


01:17:19.487 --> 01:17:20.556
10th floor.


01:17:22.607 --> 01:17:24.962
Honey.


01:17:25.327 --> 01:17:27.921
Honey,


01:17:28.167 --> 01:17:29.316
I gotta go.


01:17:29.407 --> 01:17:30.965
Wait! I will be there soon.


01:17:31.047 --> 01:17:32.765
No, don't come!


01:17:32.847 --> 01:17:34.644
It's too late.


01:17:34.727 --> 01:17:35.955
The water's up to my neck.


01:17:36.047 --> 01:17:38.481
Yoo-jin! Hold yourself together!


01:17:38.927 --> 01:17:40.645
Hold yourself together!


01:17:41.247 --> 01:17:42.885
Ji-min's here!


01:17:44.847 --> 01:17:46.565
It's Mom. Wait here for a second.


01:17:47.127 --> 01:17:48.276
Mom!


01:17:52.207 --> 01:17:53.322
Mommy!


01:17:53.407 --> 01:17:54.556
Ji-min, are you all right?


01:17:54.767 --> 01:17:56.644
-Are you hurt?
-No, I'm fine.


01:17:57.327 --> 01:17:59.124
I'm with your friend!


01:17:59.687 --> 01:18:04.078
Ji-min, listen carefully
to what I'm about to say.


01:18:04.167 --> 01:18:05.839
Get out of my way!


01:18:06.767 --> 01:18:09.520
There's one thing
I haven't been able to tell you.


01:18:10.927 --> 01:18:13.441
The man you are with now is


01:18:14.687 --> 01:18:16.723
your dad.


01:18:17.047 --> 01:18:20.039
I was going to tell you someday...


01:18:23.287 --> 01:18:26.165
Mom, why are you crying?
Come here quickly. I miss you.


01:18:26.687 --> 01:18:30.441
I miss you, too. I miss you so much.


01:18:31.647 --> 01:18:33.319
I love you.


01:18:34.287 --> 01:18:36.881
I love you, too.


01:18:37.007 --> 01:18:38.963
I love you so much.


01:18:42.367 --> 01:18:46.963
Mom! Mom!


01:18:47.327 --> 01:18:51.366
Mom! Mom!


01:18:59.687 --> 01:19:02.360
Yoo-jin! Yoo-jin!


01:19:09.567 --> 01:19:11.080
Yoo-jin!


01:19:42.327 --> 01:19:43.919
Come outside quickly!


01:20:56.447 --> 01:20:58.403
Hold on a little longer!


01:21:03.767 --> 01:21:05.598
Grab my hand!


01:21:33.367 --> 01:21:35.119
Hold on! Honey, hold my hand tight.


01:21:35.487 --> 01:21:36.966
If you let go of my hand,


01:21:37.047 --> 01:21:39.083
you're a dead man!


01:21:40.527 --> 01:21:43.280
Yeon-hee!


01:21:44.207 --> 01:21:46.004
I want to tell you one last thing!


01:21:46.087 --> 01:21:47.964
What is it?


01:21:48.047 --> 01:21:50.277
I was going to say this earlier,


01:21:50.527 --> 01:21:55.043
but I couldn't bring myself to do it.


01:21:55.967 --> 01:21:57.958
Shut your mouth and just hold on.


01:21:58.047 --> 01:22:00.242
No, no.


01:22:01.167 --> 01:22:03.601
If I die like this,
my soul will never be at peace.


01:22:04.647 --> 01:22:05.762
What are you talking about?


01:22:05.847 --> 01:22:08.407
Aren't you going to marry me?


01:22:08.487 --> 01:22:10.876
Were you just playing with me?


01:22:11.047 --> 01:22:12.400
No, I wasn't kidding.


01:22:13.167 --> 01:22:15.123
I meant it.


01:22:15.567 --> 01:22:19.276
I really love you!


01:22:19.407 --> 01:22:21.875
Then live!


01:22:22.647 --> 01:22:25.366
If you live, we can get
married or whatever you want!


01:22:27.167 --> 01:22:28.646
Thanks.


01:22:28.727 --> 01:22:30.365
Thank you so much.


01:22:30.487 --> 01:22:32.876
Stop!


01:22:33.567 --> 01:22:36.877
If you die today, I'll really kill you!


01:22:37.447 --> 01:22:39.836
Hold tight.


01:22:41.407 --> 01:22:42.476
Yeon-hee!


01:22:43.207 --> 01:22:45.721
Live on.


01:22:46.887 --> 01:22:47.922
Man-sik!


01:22:48.847 --> 01:22:49.916
Live on...


01:22:51.207 --> 01:22:53.323
-Yeon-hee, and be happy.
-Man-sik!


01:22:53.607 --> 01:22:56.997
Man-sik! Man-sik!


01:23:00.367 --> 01:23:01.516
Man-sik!


01:23:05.967 --> 01:23:07.002
Man-sik!


01:23:12.967 --> 01:23:14.116
Man-sik!


01:23:14.687 --> 01:23:16.678
Wake up, man!


01:23:16.967 --> 01:23:18.798
Baby, hold tight!


01:23:19.047 --> 01:23:21.641
Come here! Come here, man!


01:23:34.407 --> 01:23:35.522
Hold on tight.


01:23:36.447 --> 01:23:37.960
Hold on tight, man!


01:23:43.367 --> 01:23:44.436
Man-sik!


01:23:45.527 --> 01:23:46.596
You all right?


01:23:49.647 --> 01:23:52.445
Good. Good.


01:23:53.047 --> 01:23:55.436
We are safe now.


01:23:58.607 --> 01:23:59.676
Eok-jo!


01:24:01.567 --> 01:24:02.682
Eok-jo!


01:24:07.767 --> 01:24:08.916
Eok-jo!


01:24:09.647 --> 01:24:13.196
Uncle! Uncle!


01:24:15.687 --> 01:24:17.439
Uncle!


01:24:21.367 --> 01:24:23.198
Uncle!


01:24:23.927 --> 01:24:26.361
Uncle!


01:24:32.127 --> 01:24:33.276
Are you okay?


01:24:39.207 --> 01:24:40.276
What's happening?


01:24:40.647 --> 01:24:41.682
I think it's too heavy!


01:24:42.567 --> 01:24:45.001
What are you doing? Hurry up!


01:24:45.127 --> 01:24:46.685
Wait a second!


01:24:52.607 --> 01:24:54.199
The rope is about to fall apart!


01:24:54.287 --> 01:24:55.322
Then what?


01:24:55.887 --> 01:24:56.922
Just a second.


01:24:57.127 --> 01:24:58.276
What's wrong?


01:24:58.367 --> 01:25:02.280
The rope is about to break.


01:25:02.487 --> 01:25:04.159
-What?
-Hold on just a second.


01:25:19.287 --> 01:25:21.721
What if it's just one person?


01:25:23.087 --> 01:25:25.760
Yeah, it may be able to handle just one!


01:25:27.327 --> 01:25:30.080
No, Hyung-sik, no!


01:25:33.007 --> 01:25:34.918
Don't!


01:26:09.767 --> 01:26:10.836
What are you doing?


01:26:14.647 --> 01:26:15.716
Hey!


01:26:18.967 --> 01:26:20.082
Give this watch to


01:26:21.327 --> 01:26:23.045
Hi-mi over there.


01:26:27.327 --> 01:26:28.840
Hyung-sik, no!


01:26:29.647 --> 01:26:30.796
Don't!


01:26:34.007 --> 01:26:35.076
Do something!


01:26:35.207 --> 01:26:36.322
Hold on! It's too dangerous!


01:26:43.047 --> 01:26:44.116
Don't worry!


01:26:46.247 --> 01:26:48.477
It's not 3 o'clock yet.


01:26:49.767 --> 01:26:52.486
No! Don't!


01:27:06.887 --> 01:27:07.956
Don't let him go!


01:27:10.047 --> 01:27:13.039
Hurry back and don't take too long.


01:27:13.127 --> 01:27:17.120
No! You cut off that rope, you are gonna die!


01:28:22.687 --> 01:28:23.756
Hyung-sik!


01:28:26.247 --> 01:28:27.316
No!


01:28:35.687 --> 01:28:38.360
Women and children first!


01:28:38.447 --> 01:28:39.482
Here is a kid.


01:28:43.127 --> 01:28:45.436
Mommy!


01:28:46.567 --> 01:28:47.682
-Yoo-jin!
-Mommy!


01:28:53.207 --> 01:28:54.356
Are you okay?


01:28:54.607 --> 01:28:55.722
I'm okay.


01:28:57.927 --> 01:28:59.076
Okay!


01:29:12.127 --> 01:29:13.196
Here's a kid!


01:29:14.567 --> 01:29:15.966
Move! Move out the way!


01:29:16.047 --> 01:29:17.082
Here's a kid!


01:29:17.167 --> 01:29:18.759
Move out the way!


01:29:21.567 --> 01:29:24.525
Here's a kid! This is my daughter.


01:29:27.687 --> 01:29:29.678
Please take her.


01:29:54.287 --> 01:29:55.606
I'll take care of her.


01:29:56.527 --> 01:29:57.801
Don't worry.


01:37:16.000 --> 01:37:21.800
Subtitles: Arigon


01:30:08.367 --> 01:30:09.436
Ji-min!


01:30:11.207 --> 01:30:12.959
I'm your dad!


01:30:27.767 --> 01:30:29.485
Daddy!


01:30:36.487 --> 01:30:40.560
Daddy!


01:31:44.247 --> 01:31:45.600
And you call yourself a man?


01:31:49.927 --> 01:31:50.996
Yoo-jin.


01:31:54.167 --> 01:31:55.236
Sorry.


01:31:56.447 --> 01:31:57.516
I'm sorry.


01:31:57.727 --> 01:31:58.796
I'm so sorry, Yoo-jin.


01:32:00.927 --> 01:32:02.838
Me too.


01:32:33.447 --> 01:32:34.516
Help! Help!


01:32:50.927 --> 01:32:53.760
Help! Help!


01:32:54.047 --> 01:32:55.162
Grandma!


01:32:55.487 --> 01:32:56.636
Seung-hyun!


01:32:58.567 --> 01:33:00.398
Seung-hyun, come on over here!


01:33:00.487 --> 01:33:03.047
You should swim.


01:33:03.847 --> 01:33:05.678
-I can't swim.
-What are you doing?


01:33:06.087 --> 01:33:07.236
Jump into the water.


01:33:07.927 --> 01:33:09.042
I'm not that good of a swimmer.


01:33:09.207 --> 01:33:10.276
What?


01:33:10.367 --> 01:33:11.516
I can only do the doggy paddle.


01:33:11.607 --> 01:33:14.326
You crazy guy!


01:33:23.807 --> 01:33:24.842
Here! Here! Help! Help!


01:33:52.367 --> 01:33:53.880
We should not forget


01:33:54.407 --> 01:33:57.240
the sacrifice of ocean rescue workers


01:33:58.567 --> 01:34:00.683
who put the lives of those in danger


01:34:01.327 --> 01:34:04.444
ahead of their own.


01:34:06.367 --> 01:34:08.403
In the face of such adversity,


01:34:08.807 --> 01:34:12.243
they worked fearlessly


01:34:12.687 --> 01:34:15.406
to secure the safety of the people.


01:34:21.527 --> 01:34:26.396
We express our deepest respect
and honour to them.


01:34:28.807 --> 01:34:32.356
We bear the guilt
of sending them to their death


01:34:32.647 --> 01:34:38.404
when we look upon
the faces of their families.


01:34:39.727 --> 01:34:46.166
We have gathered here today
to offer these heroes


01:34:47.207 --> 01:34:50.677
a worthy send off
to their eternal resting place.


01:35:22.487 --> 01:35:24.921
Then who saved you?


01:35:25.607 --> 01:35:27.245
Me?


01:35:27.967 --> 01:35:29.002
Mom's friend...


01:35:29.687 --> 01:35:30.722
Friend?


01:35:32.527 --> 01:35:34.358
I mean my dad.


01:35:34.527 --> 01:35:35.562
Ji-min!


01:35:36.647 --> 01:35:37.762
It's time to go.


01:35:38.167 --> 01:35:39.202
I'm coming!


01:35:40.087 --> 01:35:42.647
-Goodbye.
-Bye bye.


01:35:46.767 --> 01:35:50.555
Hey! Have we met before?


01:36:01.287 --> 01:36:04.245
Anyhow, don't you think Eok-jo was great?


01:36:04.327 --> 01:36:05.521
Right!


01:36:05.607 --> 01:36:07.563
When did he go to the office
and cancel the licence?


01:36:07.847 --> 01:36:10.077
I heard he went there
when the earthquake was happening,


01:36:10.287 --> 01:36:11.402
just before the tsunami struck.


01:36:12.087 --> 01:36:14.282
If he hadn't gone to the office,


01:36:14.367 --> 01:36:15.436
he would still be alive.


01:36:16.207 --> 01:36:18.198
He is not the only one who was unlucky.


01:36:18.487 --> 01:36:19.602
Think about Dong-choon's mother.


01:36:19.887 --> 01:36:23.482
She got off the picnic bus to buy his shoes.


01:36:24.607 --> 01:36:26.723
By the way, I heard that
Dong-choon won an award?


01:36:27.127 --> 01:36:28.640
What award?


01:36:28.727 --> 01:36:30.399
Poor you, haven't you heard anything?


01:36:30.887 --> 01:36:32.718
He got a ''Courageous Citizen Award''.


01:36:32.807 --> 01:36:35.196
He saved 13 people
under the Gwangan Bridge.


01:36:35.287 --> 01:36:37.278
That loser?


01:36:37.367 --> 01:36:38.482
Yeah.


01:36:38.567 --> 01:36:42.003
Seung-hyun and Man-sik's mom
were saved by Dong-choon.


01:36:42.127 --> 01:36:45.085
Wow, the world really is full of surprises.


01:36:47.247 --> 01:36:49.238
Aren't you gonna work?


01:37:10.487 --> 01:37:13.240
Mom...


01:37:50.207 --> 01:37:52.357
-What's this?
-What are you doing?


01:37:52.567 --> 01:37:53.636
-Give it back!
-What's this?


01:37:55.167 --> 01:37:56.236
Give it back!


01:37:58.087 --> 01:37:59.122
What is this?


01:37:59.287 --> 01:38:00.402
Give it back!


01:38:00.687 --> 01:38:01.756
Man-sik!


01:38:01.887 --> 01:38:03.036
What is this?


01:38:05.647 --> 01:38:06.716
Run and get it!


01:38:07.287 --> 01:38:08.879
-Hurry!
-What the hell is that?


01:38:09.007 --> 01:38:10.156
-Hurry up! Hurry.
-All right!


01:38:12.007 --> 01:38:13.156
Run!


01:38:13.967 --> 01:38:15.082
I am running!


01:38:15.327 --> 01:38:16.442
Run, Man-sik!


01:38:16.887 --> 01:38:17.922
What's wrong with you?

